  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Development: Enhancing Food Security through Sustainable Agriculture, Local Economy Development and Healthy Diets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s development objective is to increase and diversify household income while heightening resilience to climate and economic shocks through local food systems development. The project also seeks to empower women by increasing their participation in productive activities and decision-making processes, while reducing unequal workloads and gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
